WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.073
The floor lead opens a personal invitation.

00:00:03.073 --> 00:00:07.413
Their workspace lists the gala and the task
assigned to them.

00:00:08.463 --> 00:00:09.729
Open the gala.

00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:14.163
The floor lead sees the guest arrival walk
and its current status.

00:00:14.163 --> 00:00:16.486
The task starts in To do.

00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:21.243
After walking the route, choose Done and
save.

00:00:21.243 --> 00:00:23.901
The task board confirms the change,

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:27.365
and the workspace overview reflects the
completed assignment.

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:31.895
After checking the completion count, sign
out.

00:00:31.895 --> 00:00:35.969
The next visit begins at the private
invitation screen.
